====== Linksys WAG354G ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The Linksys WAG354G is an ADSL gateway with wireless acccess point integrated.


===== Supported Versions =====
^ Version/Model ^ Launch Date ^ S/N ^ OpenWrt Version Supported ^ Model Specific Notes ^
| WAG354G  |  :?:  | - | Backfire 10.03.1 | only WEP encryption |
| ::: | ::: | ::: | Attitude Adjustment 12.09 | - |
| ::: | ::: | ::: | Barrier Breaker 14.07 | only without web interface (i.e. [[docs:guide-user:luci:luci.essentials|LuCI]]) |
| WAG354G v2   |  :?:  | - |  -  | - |

